        "quote": "简单总结您需要记住的："
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02007",
        "explanation": "Caregiver acknowledged and committed to executing the bounded plan.",
        "quote": "接下来两三天继续守住"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "Closure is safe and executable: the caregiver has a concrete short-term insulin/monitoring plan, hypoglycemia and emergency thresholds, and a plan for pathology/hepatobiliary follow-up while acknowledging that long-term diabetes and biliary decisions remain offline responsibilities.",
