          "quote": "最近一次住院的出入院记录"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01060",
          "explanation": "Doctor integrated later surgical-status information as an unresolved elective surgical pathway rather than assuming completed or immediately mandatory surgery.",
