          "explanation": "Doctor asked the caregiver to gather decision-critical discharge and imaging materials.",
          "quote": "腹部超声或CT报告"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor did not accept the incomplete opening story as definitive, used workspace retrieval attempts, requested discharge/CT/medication materials, and incorporated later family-verified transition facts into the plan.",
